This component runs inside customer infrastructure under a read-only credential.
It is published so that any security reviewer can verify two claims by reading
the source rather than trusting a data flow diagram:

  SEC-16  The collector holds no write permission and contains no code path
          that mutates customer infrastructure.
  SEC-18  Only derived metadata leaves the customer account. There is no code
          path, under any configuration, that transmits a payload body.
